{"id":"cfff0ee698e54323","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-hom-functor.md","title":"Hom Functor","display":"df-hom-functor — Hom Functor","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-hom-functor","aliases":["58-df-hom-functor"],"display":"df-hom-functor — Hom Functor","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-hom-functor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-hom-functor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hom-functor — Hom Functor"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8790486ac053461c\" href=\"?note=8790486ac053461c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md\">../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in C_0\">\\(c\\in C_0\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\">\\(F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S\\)</span> (category predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8790486ac053461c\" href=\"?note=8790486ac053461c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md\">../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function-graph predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HomFunctor}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HomFunctor}_S\\)</span> (Hom-functor predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hom\\text{-}functor}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HomFunctor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,c)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e,F_0,F_1\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\n\\land F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land c\\in C_0\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F_0,C_0,\\mathcal P(C_1))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F_1,C_1,\\mathcal P(C_1\\times C_1))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x\\in C_0\\;\nF_0(x)=\\{g\\in C_1\\mid s(g)=c\\land t(g)=x\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall f\\in C_1\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(F_1(f),F_0(s(f)),F_0(t(f)))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{31mm}\\land\nF_1(f)=\\{\\langle g,f\\circ g\\rangle\\mid\ng\\in C_1\\land s(g)=c\\land t(g)=s(f)\\}\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hom\\text{-}functor}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HomFunctor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,c)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e,F_0,F_1\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\n\\land F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land c\\in C_0\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F_0,C_0,\\mathcal P(C_1))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F_1,C_1,\\mathcal P(C_1\\times C_1))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x\\in C_0\\;\nF_0(x)=\\{g\\in C_1\\mid s(g)=c\\land t(g)=x\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall f\\in C_1\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(F_1(f),F_0(s(f)),F_0(t(f)))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{31mm}\\land\nF_1(f)=\\{\\langle g,f\\circ g\\rangle\\mid\ng\\in C_1\\land s(g)=c\\land t(g)=s(f)\\}\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The object and arrow maps are separated as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_0,F_1\">\\(F_0,F_1\\)</span>, and every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_1(f)\">\\(F_1(f)\\)</span> is a typed function graph between the corresponding Hom-sets.</li>\n<li>The former clause applied the small-category predicate to the proper category <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}\\)</span>. The repaired definition records the representable functor's set-valued data directly; functoriality follows from the identity and associativity laws already carried by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"8790486ac053461c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"8790486ac053461c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S$ (category predicate; see [[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function-graph predicate; see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in C_0","display":false},{"tex":"F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HomFunctor}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hom\\text{-}functor}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HomFunctor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,c)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e,F_0,F_1\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\n\\land F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land c\\in C_0\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F_0,C_0,\\mathcal P(C_1))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F_1,C_1,\\mathcal P(C_1\\times C_1))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall x\\in C_0\\;\nF_0(x)=\\{g\\in C_1\\mid s(g)=c\\land t(g)=x\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall f\\in C_1\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(F_1(f),F_0(s(f)),F_0(t(f)))\\\\\n&\\hspace{31mm}\\land\nF_1(f)=\\{\\langle g,f\\circ g\\rangle\\mid\ng\\in C_1\\land s(g)=c\\land t(g)=s(f)\\}\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"F_0,F_1","display":false},{"tex":"F_1(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Set}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false}],"bytes":1814,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-632","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-hom-functor.md|58-df-hom-functor]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["8790486ac053461c","36d7463d215be751"]}